1
00:00:00,573 --> 00:00:03,823
(Sheldon:)Satellites are down. Solar flares.

2
00:00:03,993 --> 00:00:06,413
-There are no solar flares now.
SHELDON: Yes, there are.

3
00:00:06,579 --> 00:00:10,879
(Raj:)Dude, I'm an astrophysicist. If there
were solar flares, I'd be all up in it.

4
00:00:12,752 --> 00:00:14,332
(Sheldon:)I'm sorry, I misspoke.

5
00:00:14,503 --> 00:00:17,883
(Sheldon:)What I meant to say
was my battery died.

6
00:00:19,967 --> 00:00:22,717
(Leonard:)-What the hell was that about?
-I don't know.

7
00:00:22,887 --> 00:00:26,097
(Raj:)Do you think this is really Hillary Clinton
doing it with Oprah?

8
00:00:28,559 --> 00:00:31,599
Aw, we really need to get you a girl.

9
00:00:34,398 --> 00:00:35,438
[KNOCKING ON DOOR]

10
00:00:35,608 --> 00:00:36,648
SHELDON:
Leonard.

11
00:00:37,234 --> 00:00:38,614
(Sheldon:)Leonard.

12
00:00:38,819 --> 00:00:40,649
(Sheldon:)-Leonard.
-Oh, just come in!

13
00:00:43,115 --> 00:00:45,825
(Sheldon:)Thanks for seeing me
on such short notice.

14
00:00:48,913 --> 00:00:50,543
(Leonard:)What do you want, Sheldon?

15
00:00:51,165 --> 00:00:53,245
(Sheldon:)Maybe this isn't a good time.

16
00:00:53,417 --> 00:00:57,127
(Leonard:)Tell me why you woke me up
or I swear to God I will kill you.

17
00:00:57,922 --> 00:01:02,022
(Sheldon:)Do you really think death threats are an
appropriate way to begin conversation?

